OL,3,GNEWSAStar Trek offers 'optimistic view
OL,4,Aof the future'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I have a very grounding day job
OL,7,Fdealing with very serious issues. It's
OL,8,Fimportant to have an escape," he said.
